se VoiceOS for other requests. Track its progress, cancel it if needed, and revisit completed results in your history\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Use Open answer to read the agent’s response and sources in a larger window, keep your reading position, and save the response as a PDF\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Use Open answer to read the agent’s response and sources in a larger window, keep your reading position, and save the response as a PDF\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Wide tables now stay inside the answer with horizontal scrolling, so you can read every column without leaving the conversation\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Wide tables now stay inside the answer with horizontal scrolling, so you can read every column without leaving the conversation\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"li\",\"When a new foreground answer contains a single draft or code block, VoiceOS automatically copies it for pasting. Answers with multiple options leave your clipboard unchanged\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"When a new foreground answer contains a single draft or code block, VoiceOS automatically copies it for pasting. Answers with multiple options leave your clipboard unchanged\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"li\",\"VoiceOS retries transcription when speech is detected but no text is returned, and preserves the recording in local history for recovery if the retry fails\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"VoiceOS retries transcription when speech is detected but no text is returned, and preserves the recording in local history for recovery if the retry fails\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Clearer Codex connection errors help you identify problems and sign in again when your session has expired\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Clearer Codex connection errors help you identify problems and sign in again when your session has expired\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}]\n37:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Japanese dictation handles lists, paragraphs, and corrections better\",\"$undefined\"]}]\n38:[\"$\",\"li\",\"VoiceOS remembers your weather preferences: Celsius or Fahrenheit for temperature, and kilometers per hour (km/h) or miles per hour (mph) for wind. Unless you choose otherwise, Celsius uses km/h and Fahrenheit uses mph\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"VoiceOS remembers your weather preferences: Celsius or Fahrenheit for temperature, and kilometers per hour (km/h) or miles per hour (mph) for wind. Unless you choose otherwise, Celsius uses km/h and Fahrenheit uses mph\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Clicking the arrow button to finish dictation now returns focus to your app before pasting, so the text reaches the field you were writing in\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Clicking the arrow button to finish dictation now returns focus to your app before pasting, so the text reaches the field you were writing in\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"li\",\"The dictation progress indicator now stays in sync with text insertion, with smoother transitions between states\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"The dictation progress indicator now stays in sync with text insertion, with smoother transitions between states\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Fixed an issue that could discard dictated names, addresses, or lists when they also appeared on screen\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Fixed an issue that could discard dictated names, addresses, or lists when they also appeared on screen\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Clicking the dictation bar, notch, or agent notifications no longer brings the dashboard forward unexpectedly on Mac\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Clicking the dictation bar, notch, or agent notifications no longer brings the dashboard forward unexpectedly on Mac\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-2 inline-block translate-y-[-1px] rounded-full px-2 py-[2px] align-middle text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05)\",\"color\":\"#6b7280\"},\"children\":\"Mac\"}]]}]]}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"li\",\"VoiceOS now warns you at 19 minutes, automatically finishes at 20 minutes, and pastes the completed dictation so long sessions do not end without notice\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"VoiceOS now warns you at 19 minutes, automatically finishes at 20 minutes, and pastes the completed dictation so long sessions do not end without notice\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"li\",\"If the primary transcription service ends a long session early, VoiceOS now recovers the complete recording before producing the final text\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"If the primary transcription service ends a long session early, VoiceOS now recovers the complete recording before producing the final text\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Weather cards now show the days ahead in one view and remember whether you prefer Celsius or Fahrenheit\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Weather cards now show the days ahead in one view and remember whether you prefer Celsius or Fahrenheit\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n40:[\"$\",\"li\",\"On Windows, a new Start in background option keeps the dashboard hidden at login until you open VoiceOS from the system tray\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"On Windows, a new Start in background option keeps the dashboard hidden at login until you open VoiceOS from the system tray\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n41:[\"$\",\"li\",\"On Windows, reading selected text no longer changes the clipboard when the copy shortcut cannot be sent safely\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"On Windows, reading selected text no longer changes the clipboard when the copy shortcut cannot be sent safely\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n42:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Claude Code tasks now recover more clearly from usage-credit limits and make it easier to continue with another available model\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Claude Code tasks now recover more clearly from usage-credit limits and make it easier to continue with another available model\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n43:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Agent Mode now recovers malformed result cards more gracefully instead of leaving an incomplete response\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Agent Mode now recovers malformed result cards more gracefully instead of leaving an incomplete response\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n44:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Apple Music playback controls and preview cards now stay in sync more reliably on Mac\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Apple Music playback controls and preview cards now stay in sync more reliably on Mac\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-2 inline-block translate-y-[-1px] rounded-full px-2 py-[2px] align-middle text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05)\",\"color\":\"#6b7280\"},\"children\":\"Mac\"}]]}]]}]\n45:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Hosted checkout now recovers correctly after a failed subscription payment\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Hosted checkout now recovers correctly after a failed subscription payment\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n46:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Connect Spotify to search your library and playlists, start playback on an available device, and control the live player directly from VoiceOS\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Connect Spotify to search your library and playlists, start playback on an available device, and control the live player directly from VoiceOS\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n47:[\"$\",\"li\",\"On Mac, Apple Music now works with the account already signed in on your computer, including search, playback, queue, favorites, library, and playlist actions\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"On Mac, Apple Music now works with the account already signed in on your computer, including search, playback, queue, favorites, library, and playlist actions\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-2 inline-block translate-y-[-1px] rounded-full px-2 py-[2px] align-middle text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05)\",\"color\":\"#6b7280\"},\"children\":\"Mac\"}]]}]]}]\n48:[\"$\",\"li\",\"New Spotify and Apple Music cards show artwork, track details, progress, and live controls for play, pause, skip, seek, shuffle, and repeat\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"New Spotify and Apple Music cards show artwork, track details, progress, and live controls for play, pause, skip, seek, shuffle, and repeat\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n49:[\"$\",\"li\",\"On Windows, VoiceOS now detects and reloads a blank dashboard after sleep or resume without disrupting its other windows\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"On Windows, VoiceOS now detects and reloads a blank dashboard after sleep or resume without disrupting its other windows\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n4a:[\"$\",\"li\",\"On Windows, popup clicks no longer get stuck and hovering over the pill causes less flicker or movement\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"On Windows, popup clicks no longer get stuck and hovering over the pill causes less flicker or movement\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n4b:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Windows media controls and background-audio ducking now use native helpers for more consistent behavior\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Windows media controls and background-audio ducking now use native helpers for more consistent behavior\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n4c:[\"$\",\"li\",\"VoiceOS now shows the correct active-app icon in the pill more consistently\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"VoiceOS now shows the correct active-app icon in the pill more consistently\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n4d:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Starting a recording no longer waits on slow microphone discovery, and interrupted audio startup recovers more cleanly\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Starting a recording no longer waits on slow microphone discovery, and interrupted audio startup recovers more cleanly\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n4e:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Agent Mode can keep working in the background when dictation takes over, while leaving the pill visible so you can return to the result\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Agent Mode can keep working in the background when dictation takes over, while leaving the pill visible so you can return to the result\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n4f:[\"$\",\"li\",\"During initial setup, you can now review, edit, and remove detected names and specialist terms before adding them to your dictionary\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"During initial setup, you can now review, edit, and remove detected names and specialist terms before adding them to your dictionary\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n50:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Available app updates now stay accessible from the dashboard and the notch until you install or dismiss them\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Available app updates now stay accessible from the dashboard and the notch until you install or dismiss them\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n51:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Fixed a bug that could insert dictated text in the wrong place\",\"$undefined\"]}]\n52:[\"$\",\"li\",\"VoiceOS does less repeated work in the background, reducing pauses when reading settings and keeping windows in position\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"VoiceOS does less repeated work in the background, reducing pauses when reading settings and keeping windows in position\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n53:[\"$\",\"li\",\"On Windows, dashboard animations and the Apps page now recover correctly after moving or resizing an unfocused window\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"On Windows, dashboard animations and the Apps page now recover correctly after moving or resizing an unfocused window\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n54:[\"$\",\"li\",\"VoiceOS can now restart stopped audio capture and selected-text helpers automatically, so a temporary failure does not keep interrupting later requests\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"VoiceOS can now restart stopped audio capture and selected-text helpers automatically, so a temporary failure does not keep interrupting later requests\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n55:[\"$\",\"li\",\"VoiceOS now keeps your selected microphone in sync more reliably when audio devices change\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"VoiceOS now keeps your selected microphone in sync more reliably when audio devices change\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n56:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Typing spaces during hands-free recording works correctly, stopping no longer accidentally starts a new recording, and Escape cancellation is more reliable on macOS\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Typing spaces during hands-free recording works correctly, stopping no longer accidentally starts a new recording, and Escape cancellation is more reliable on macOS\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n57:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Agent Mode now follows your enabled language choices more consistently, avoiding unexpected switches to languages you have not selected\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Agent Mode now follows your enabled language choices more consistently, avoiding unexpected switches to languages you have not selected\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n58:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Dictation now spells common AI model names more accurately\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"s