ly, apply punctuation selectively, and stay in sync with the right account\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n63:[\"$\",\"li\",\"On macOS, dictation now keeps the insertion point correct after paragraph breaks, emoji, and other rich text\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"On macOS, dictation now keeps the insertion point correct after paragraph breaks, emoji, and other rich text\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-2 inline-block translate-y-[-1px] rounded-full px-2 py-[2px] align-middle text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05)\",\"color\":\"#6b7280\"},\"children\":\"Mac\"}]]}]]}]\n64:[\"$\",\"li\",\"On Windows, the top and side overlays now share one cursor update path, reducing flicker and hover jitter\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"On Windows, the top and side overlays now share one cursor update path, reducing flicker and hover jitter\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n65:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Payment-failed and subscription-ending banners now lead straight to the right recovery action, in English and Japanese\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Payment-failed and subscription-ending banners now lead straight to the right recovery action, in English and Japanese\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n66:[\"$\",\"li\",\"New subscriptions can be completed inside initial setup with supported wallet options, with an automatic browser fallback if the embedded checkout cannot load\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"New subscriptions can be completed inside initial setup with supported wallet options, with an automatic browser fallback if the embedded checkout cannot load\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n67:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"The recording start sound now plays only after microphone audio is actually flowing, reducing false starts\",\"$undefined\"]}]\n68:[\"$\",\"li\",\"VoiceOS now releases a stale pre-warmed microphone stream cleanly when your computer wakes\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"VoiceOS now releases a stale pre-warmed microphone stream cleanly when your computer wakes\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n69:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Initial setup now offers a skip after 12 seconds and keeps its ambient soundtrack quieter\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Initial setup now offers a skip after 12 seconds and keeps its ambient soundtrack quieter\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n6a:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Screenshots stay attached across revisions to staged Agent Mode cards, so visual context is not lost while you make changes\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Screenshots stay attached across revisions to staged Agent Mode cards, so visual context is not lost while you make changes\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n6b:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Fixed agent replies occasionally showing raw internal data, and agent voice going silent on Windows after switching speakers or headphones\",\"$undefined\"]}]\n6c:[\"$\",\"li\",\"X results now arrive as readable cards — your home timeline, profiles, and DM threads laid out as a conversation — with clear confirmations before anything is posted or sent\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"X results now arrive as readable cards — your home timeline, profiles, and DM threads laid out as a conversation — with clear confirmations before anything is posted or sent\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n6d:[\"$\",\"li\",\"X reads and DMs depend on your X API tier, so the integration is marked beta\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"X reads and DMs depend on your X API tier, so the integration is marked beta\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n6e:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Five agent voices are now available: Sky, Dawn, Dusk, Midnight, and Jarvis. Anyone already using Jarvis keeps it and moves to the new delivery automatically\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Five agent voices are now available: Sky, Dawn, Dusk, Midnight, and Jarvis. Anyone already using Jarvis keeps it and moves to the new delivery automatically\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n6f:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Screenshot previews now match each shot's shape, flip above the pointer when there's more room, and no longer get clipped by the bottom of the notch window\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Screenshot previews now match each shot's shape, flip above the pointer when there's more room, and no longer get clipped by the bottom of the notch window\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n70:[\"$\",\"li\",\"In Create Prompt, the circle you draw now appears only in the captured screenshot, not on the frame that flies into the notch\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0