very build step, live terminal output, and readable action logs, with clearer setup previews and automatic crash fixes\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n74:[\"$\",\"li\",\"On Windows, circling now captures the hovered window correctly without freezing the trail\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"On Windows, circling now captures the hovered window correctly without freezing the trail\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n75:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Capturing screenshots and drawing circles no longer slows down the rest of VoiceOS\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Capturing screenshots and drawing circles no longer slows down the rest of VoiceOS\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n76:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Spoken Agent Mode replies stay reliable through longer answers, with smoother voice playback and fewer cutoffs\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Spoken Agent Mode replies stay reliable through longer answers, with smoother voice playback and fewer cutoffs\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n77:[\"$\",\"li\",\"First-run setup has been rebuilt into one smoother flow, with a clearer intro, language and profile steps, permission guidance, and hands-on practice\",{\"class