nto VoiceOS, so active work stays visible without blocking the conversation\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n90:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Claude Code and Codex tasks gained durable activity cards, editable queued follow-ups, result and prompt views, effort controls, and visibility into external sessions\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Claude Code and Codex tasks gained durable activity cards, editable queued follow-ups, result and prompt views, effort controls, and visibility into external sessions\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n91:[\"$\",\"li\",\"English Polished mode now formats speech for readability while preserving contractions, and Japanese cleanup removes stutters, doubled punctuation, and misheard product names\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"English Polished mode now formats speech for readability while preserving contractions, and Japanese cleanup removes stutters, doubled punctuation, and misheard product names\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n92:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Connecting an app from the notch resumes the request that needed it, and disconnected apps now explain why they turned off instead of silently changing state\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Connecting an app from the notch resumes the request that needed it, and disconnected apps now explain why they turned off instead of silently changing state\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n93:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Agent Mode added stop controls for active work, kept History open while tasks are inspected, and fixed long answers being clipped before they could scroll\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Agent Mode added stop controls for active work, kept History open while tasks are inspected, and fixed long answers being clipped before they could scroll\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n94:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Map answers now use Google Maps, while coding and integration cards carry the correct app branding throughout the notch\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Map answers now use Google Maps, while coding and integration cards carry the correct app branding throughout the notch\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n95:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Microphone checks no longer report a false muted state, and real capture failures now surface a clear error instead of silently producing nothing\",\"$undefined\"]}]\n96:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Reminder and notification windows keep their action areas clickable after expanding on Windows\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Reminder and notification windows keep their action areas clickable after expanding on Windows\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n97:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Denied microphone access now links directly to the relevant Windows privacy setting so you can restore recording quickly\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Denied microphone access now links directly to the relevant Windows privacy setting so you can restore recording quickly\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n98:[\"$\",\"li\",\"This release also hardened overlay recovery around the notch and sidebar after display, focus, or input-hook changes\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"This release also hardened overlay recovery around the notch and sidebar after display, focus, or input-hook changes\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n99:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Insights turns your history into speaking-speed, words-dictated, time-saved, and percentile metrics once enough sessions are available\",\"$undefined\"]}]\n9a:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Voice Type gives your dictation style a shareable identity card with a redesigned, privacy-conscious summary\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Voice Type gives your dictation style a shareable identity card with a redesigned, privacy-conscious summary\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n9b:[\"$\",\"li\",\"When you ask about the screen, Agent Mode can request screen access by voice and capture the relevant context for that turn\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"When you ask about the screen, Agent Mode can request screen access by voice and capture the relevant context for that turn\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n9c:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Hotkey capture starts faster, and macOS allows more time for slow apps to confirm a completed paste instead of marking it failed too early\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Hotkey capture starts faster, and macOS allows more time for slow apps to confirm a completed paste instead of marking it failed too early\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n9d:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Screen recordings now include the trail you draw for Agent Mode, while Windows screen-context work uses less CPU and causes fewer freezes\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{