ndar actions, while Apple Mail can search, draft, reply, and send locally on Mac\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Outlook support covers both Microsoft 365 mail and calendar actions, while Apple Mail can search, draft, reply, and send locally on Mac\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\na2:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Short dictations use VoiceOS's hosted Whisper service for a faster path, with processing-ring timing matched to the selected polishing style\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Short dictations use VoiceOS's hosted Whisper service for a faster path, with processing-ring timing matched to the selected polishing style\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\na3:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Japanese Polished mode now formats rather than rewrites: it preserves meaning while cleaning list structure, numbers, email recipients, and stray ASR break marks\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Japanese Polished mode now formats rather than rewrites: it preserves meaning while cleaning list structure, numbers, email recipients, and stray ASR break marks\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\na4:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Screen context is captured behind one explicit consent, stays disabled when screen access is off, and can be refreshed for each Agent Mode turn\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Screen context is captured behind one explicit consent, stays disabled when screen access is off, and can be refreshed for each Agent Mode turn\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\na5:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Windows dictation paste and the Insert action in reply drafts were repaired across more desktop apps\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Windows dictation paste and the Insert action in reply drafts were repaired across more desktop apps\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\na6:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Custom URL-based integrations once again support remote MCP endpoints and Authorization headers in their setup form\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Custom URL-based integrations once again support remote MCP endpoints and Authorization headers in their setup form\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\na7:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Background dispatch now preserves the original transcript and closes several races that could lose, duplicate, or prematurely present a result\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Background dispatch now preserves the original transcript and closes several races that could lose, duplicate, or prematurely present a result\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\na8:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}]\na9:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Reminder cards support links, update in place when a schedule changes, avoid covering an active notch, and stay aware of the notification already on screen\",\"$undefined\"]}]\naa:[\"$\",\"li\",\"The new App Store foundation adds manifest-backed integrations, a browse gallery, capability and permission pages, animated previews, and consistent confirmation cards\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"The new App Store foundation adds manifest-backed integrations, a browse gallery, capability and permission pages, animated previews, and consistent confirmation cards\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nab:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Developers can scaffold an integration from one prompt, preview it in VoiceOS, and hand the generated project to a coding agent for further work\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Developers can scaffold an integration from one prompt, preview it in VoiceOS, and hand the generated project to a coding agent for further work\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nac:[\"$\",\"li\",\"The dictation pipeline now blends fast and high-accuracy speech recognition, then routes polishing by length and the selected Raw, Light, or Polished style\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"The dictation pipeline now blends fast and high-accuracy speech recognition, then routes polishing by length and the selected Raw, Light, or Polished style\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nad:[\"$\",\"li\",\"An adaptive progress ring reflects the active transcription stage, and long Polished dictations use a model better suited to preserving structure over extended takes\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"An adaptive progress ring reflects the active transcription stage, and long Polished dictations use a model better suited to preserving structure over extended takes\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nae:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Files attached in Agent Mode can now be saved to disk for real, while location answers avoid pretending an IP estimate is an exact position\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Files attached in Agent Mode can now be saved to disk for real, while location answers avoid pretending an IP estimate is an exact position\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\naf:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Idle background work was reduced so VoiceOS uses less CPU when you are not interacting with it and allows the computer to sleep normally\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Idle background work was reduced so VoiceOS uses less CPU when you are not interacting with it and allows the computer to sleep normally\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nb0:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Agent voice speed is adjustable in Settings, and web answers can include multiple relevant image previews instead of a single thumbnail\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Agent voice speed is adjustable in Settings, and web answers can include multiple relevant image previews instead of a single thumbnail\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nb1:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Verified students can access academic pricing, and the cancellation flow more clearly explains eligible retention offers\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Verified students can access academic pricing, and the cancellation flow more clearly explains eligible retention offers\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nb2:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Plus more fixes and improvements\",\"$undefined\"]}]\nb3:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Finder results use a native-style gallery with thumbnails, drag-out support, Open With, editable names for created files, and clear confirmations before local changes\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Finder results use a native-style gallery with thumbnails, drag-out support, Open With, editable names for created files, and clear confirmations before local changes\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-2 inline-block translate-y-[-1px] rounded-full px-2 py-[2px] align-middle text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05)\",\"color\":\"#6b7280\"},\"children\":\"Mac\"}]]}]]}]\nb4:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Folder searches now handle large or truncated listings honestly, resolve familiar folders, and enforce stronger path privacy checks\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Folder searches now handle large or truncated listings honestly, resolve familiar folders, and enforce stronger path privacy checks\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-2 inline-block translate-y-[-1px] rounded-full px-2 py-[2px] align-mid