eekly Agent Mode usage is visible in the dashboard and billing settings, with an upgrade card shown only when a turn is actually blocked by the plan\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nb8:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Every voice turn refreshes its screen view, preventing answers based on a stale screenshot after the visible app changes\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Every voice turn refreshes its screen view, preventing answers based on a stale screenshot after the visible app changes\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nb9:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Empty or stalled model rounds now recover through a fallback path instead of returning a placeholder or blank answer\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Empty or stalled model rounds now recover through a fallback path instead of returning a placeholder or blank answer\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nba:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Integration connection status refreshes promptly after OAuth, and connect feedback appears as a clear toast instead of shifting the settings layout\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Integration connection status refreshes promptly after OAuth, and connect feedback appears as a clear toast instead of shifting the settings layout\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nbb:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Hold-to-draw follows the cursor continuously without requiring clicks, making it easier to point at a region while you explain what should change\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Hold-to-draw follows the cursor continuously without requiring clicks, making it easier to point at a region while you explain what should change\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nbc:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Reply drafting gained a dedicated screen-aware card with reliable Insert and Enter actions that collapse cleanly after the text is placed\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Reply drafting gained a dedicated screen-aware card with reliable Insert and Enter actions that collapse cleanly after the text is placed\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nbd:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Conversation context now survives interruptions and barge-ins, while multiple preview images can stay attached to a visual web answer\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Conversation context now survives interruptions and barge-ins, while multiple preview images can stay attached to a visual web answer\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nbe:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Audio capture detects and recovers streams that die during recording, and the clipboard is restored with all formats—not only text—after Agent Mode uses it\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Audio capture detects and recovers streams that die during recording, and the clipboard is restored with all formats—not only text—after Agent Mode uses it\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nbf:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Dictation defaults to prose unless you clearly ask for a list, with tighter cleanup that preserves the speaker's structure instead of over-formatting it\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Dictation defaults to prose unless you clearly ask for a list, with tighter cleanup that preserves the speaker's structure instead of over-formatting it\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nc0:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Plan cards and the cancellation flow were simplified, with regional currency parity and clearer trial and yearly-offer terms\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Plan cards and the cancellation flow were simplified, with regional currency parity and clearer trial and yearly-offer terms\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nc1:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Image previews, file confirmations, and integration suggestions were visually tightened so important actions remain visible in the notch\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Image previews, file confirmations, and integration suggestions were visually tightened so important actions remain visible in the notch\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nc2:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Nearby-place results preserve the exact map view shown in the notch when opened, with better place hours and smoother result browsing\",\"$undefined\"]}]\nc3:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Selected text remains visibly attached to the Agent Mode turn until the next request, with improved Japanese bold and italic rendering around that context\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Selected text remains visibly attached to the Agent Mode turn until the next request, with improved Japanese bold and italic rendering around that context\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nc4:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Secure Keyboard Entry is detected on Mac and explained instead of making the shortcut appear broken, while trigger-key choices are limited to reliable modifier keys\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"clas