ace, and remain open until you click away\",\"$undefined\"]}]\ncb:[\"$\",\"li\",\"The side notch gained a liquid-glass history view with click-to-open conversations, selected-session highlighting, haptics, and an Agent shortcut double-tap\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"The side notch gained a liquid-glass history view with click-to-open conversations, selected-session highlighting, haptics, and an Agent shortcut double-tap\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ncc:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Answers reveal word by word, remain selectable and copyable, and show clearer source details for web and Google workspace results\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Answers reveal word by word, remain selectable and copyable, and show clearer source details for web and Google workspace results\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ncd:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Continuous spoken sessions gained more natural language-aware voices, warmer realtime connections, coordinated start and completion lines, and a true mute control\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Continuous spoken sessions gained more natural language-aware voices, warmer realtime connections, coordinated start and completion lines, and a true mute control\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nce:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Apple Calendar moved to a native EventKit backend for recurring and multi-day events, meeting links, all-day events, and more reliable packaged-app access\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Apple Calendar moved to a native EventKit backend for recurring and multi-day events, meeting links, all-day events, and more reliable packaged-app access\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-2 inline-block translate-y-[-1px] rounded-full px-2 py-[2px] align-middle text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05)\",\"color\":\"#6b7280\"},\"children\":\"Mac\"}]]}]]}]\ncf:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Reminders also moved away from AppleScript to native APIs, improving access and reliability for created tasks\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Reminders also moved away from AppleScript to native APIs, improving access and reliability for created tasks\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-2 inline-block translate-y-[-1px] rounded-full px-2 py-[2px] align-middle text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05)\",\"color\":\"#6b7280\"},\"children\":\"Mac\"}]]}]]}]\nd0:[\"$\",\"li\",\"A warm native microphone path makes push-to-talk feel immediate, protects the final audio during stop, and lowers background media while you speak instead of muting it\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"A warm native microphone path makes push-to-talk feel immediate, protects the final audio during stop, and lowers background media while you speak instead of muting it\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nd1:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Agent Mode can open websites in a named browser or the active Chrome profile, while open-app requests prefer an installed native app before falling back to its website\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Agent Mode can open websites in a named browser or the active Chrome profile, while open-app requests prefer an installed native app before falling back to its website\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nd2:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Files and captured context can be dragged into the notch with clear attachment staging, and pending confirmation cards return from History after a relaunch\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Files and captured context can be dragged into the notch with clear attachment staging, and pending confirmation cards return from History after a relaunch\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nd3:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Near-me requests use live geolocation and a map card, with Windows support and an exact-view handoff when the map opens\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Near-me requests use live geolocation and a map card, with Windows support and an exact-view handoff when the map opens\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nd4:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Memory gained lockable core preferences, and confirmation settings were reframed as per-integration permission bypasses so action safety is easier to understand\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Memory gained lockable core preferences, and confirmation settings were reframed as per-integration permission bypasses so action safety is easier to understand\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nd5:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Windows focus, paste, and window-activation paths were hardened to avoid freezes, while hover and click geometry around both notches was stabilized\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Windows focus, paste, and window-activation paths were hardened to avoid freezes, while hover and click geometry around both notches was stabilized\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nd6:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Stacked previews animate more smoothly, expand based on their real contents, and keep confirmation buttons and overlays reachable in compact layouts\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Stacked previews animate more smoothly, expand based on their real contents, and keep confirmation buttons and overlays reachable in compact layouts\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nd7:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Gmail, Slack, and Linear handoffs gained more consistent button placement, clearer labels, and better transitions into the native app or browser\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Gmail, Slack, and Linear handoffs gained more consistent button placement, clearer labels, and better transitions into the native app or browser\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nd8:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Writing-style instructions were restored and tightened, while transcript splitting became less aggressive so longer thoughts stay together\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Writing-style instructions were restored and tightened, while transcript splitting became less aggressive so longer thoughts stay together\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nd9:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Known ASR hallucinations are filtered with language-specific heuristics without removing ordinary phrases that happen to look similar\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Known ASR hallucinations are filtered with language-specific heuristics without removing ordinary phrases that happen to look similar\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nda:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Connection-gated tools no longer appear usable before their app is connected, reducing integration errors and misleading Agent responses\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Connection-gated tools no longer appear usable before their app is connected, reducing integration errors and misleading Agent responses\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ndb:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Empty speech-recognition results skip polishing entirely, while low-quality audio gets stricter fallback handling instead of producing confident nonsense\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Empty speech-recognition results skip polishing entirely, while low-quality audio gets stricter fallback handling instead of producing confident nonsense\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ndc:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Dictated lists, spelled-out letters, and long paragraphs received dedicated formatting rules, including improved Japanese email structure\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Dictated lists, spelled-out letters, and long paragraphs received dedicated formatting rules, including improved Japanese email structure\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ndd:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Windows dead keys are handled correctly by the keyboard listener, reducing broken accents and shortcut interference on international layouts\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Windows dead keys are handled correctly by the keyboard listener, reducing broken accents and shortcut interference on international layouts\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nde:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Screen Recording permission for Agent screenshots now follows a clearer recovery path, and screenshot previews no longer flash at the wrong opacity\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Screen Recording permission for Agent screenshots now follows a clearer recovery path, and screenshot previews no longer flash at the wrong opacity\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ndf:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Calendar edits survive the confirmation form, and Slack thread previews render the correct message sequence before an action is approved\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Calendar edits survive the confirmation form, and Slack thread previews render the correct message sequence before an action is approved\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ne0:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Onboarding troubleshooting gained direct support actions so permission or setup problems can be reported without leaving the flow\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Onboarding troubleshooting gained direct support actions so permission or setup problems can be reported without leaving the flow\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ne1:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}]\ne2:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"The new AI-assisted Spelling import accepts a batch of names or terms, turns them into dictionary entries, and presents the result in a compact review modal\",\"$undefined\"]}]\ne3:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Restored dictionary entries keep their enabled state consistently, including data imported from earlier versions\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Restored dictionary entries keep their enabled state consistently, including data imported from earlier versions\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ne4:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Writing-style cards have stronger contrast and more reliable instructions, reducing cases where dictation ignored the selected style\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Writing-style cards have stronger contrast and more reliable instructions, reducing cases where dictation ignored the selected style\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ne5:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Cancelling a dictation no longer leaves the Fn trigger blocked, so the next recording can begin normally\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Cancelling a dictation no longer leaves the Fn trigger blocked, so the next recording can begin normally\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ne6:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Agent Mode now pastes the user's intended input instead of accidentally inserting the assistant's response into the active app\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Agent Mode now pastes the user's intended input instead of accidentally inserting the assistant's response into the active app\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ne7:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Connected integrations are prioritized in setup and raw internal app links are hidden, producing cleaner confirmations and fewer dead ends\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Connected integrations are prioritized in setup and raw internal app links are hidden, producing cleaner confirmations and fewer dead ends\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ne8:[\"$\",\"li\",\"The founder-contact experience was simplified and fully localized, making direct product feedback easier from the dashboard\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"The founder-contact experience was simplified and fully localized, making direct product feedback easier from the dashboard\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ne9:[\"$\",\"li\",\"History preserves paragraph and list formatting from the original dictation instead of flattening every saved session into plain text\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"History preserves paragraph and list formatting from the original dictation instead of flattening every saved session into plain text\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nea:[\"$\",\"li\",\"The macOS paste helper is prewarmed at launch and runs on a stable event loop, reducing beachballs and delays when text is inserted\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"The macOS paste helper is prewarmed at launch and runs on a stable event loop, reducing beachballs and delays when text is inserted\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-2 inline-block translate-y-[-1px] rounded-full px-2 py-[2px] align-middle text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05)\",\"color\":\"#6b7280\"},\"children\":\"Mac\"}]]}]]}]\neb:[\"$\",\"li\",\"VoiceOS blocks overlapping dictations and suppresses the early recording sound while another capture is busy, preventing mixed or lost transcripts\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"VoiceOS blocks overlapping dictations and suppresses the early recording sound while another capture is busy, preventing mixed or lost transcripts\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nec:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Voice Agent sessions are saved to History as soon as a reply begins, so a relaunch does not erase the conversation that just completed\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Voice Agent sessions are saved to History as soon as a reply begins, so a relaunch does not erase the conversation that just completed\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\ned:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Gmail answers include robust, underlined links to the correct message thread with a clear external-open indicator\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Gmail answers include robust, underlined links to the correct message thread with a clear external-open indicator\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nee:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Grammar handling now supports accented initial letters and preserves context-aware capitalization when text begins mid-sentence\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Grammar handling now supports accented initial letters and preserves context-aware capitalization when text begins mid-sentence\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nef:[\"$\",\"li\",\"Synthetic copy shortcuts no longer leak a literal 'c' into terminals, and collapsed Agent sessions reset predictably after the configured idle period\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-[10px] h-[3px] w-[3px] shrink-0 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.22)\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-gray-600\",\"children\":[\"Synthetic copy shortcuts no longer leak a literal 'c' into terminals, and collapsed Agent sessions reset predictably after the configured idle period\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\nf0:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\